<title>USA: Wedding of a lifetime to cost far more in 1997 - SURVEY DETAILS.</title>
<headline>Wedding of a lifetime to cost far more in 1997 - SURVEY DETAILS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>It is costing more than ever to hold a formal wedding. Here are two recent surveys that illustrate the point.</p>
